or several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After being unemployed for several years, a man devises a unique plan to secure a new job: eliminate his competition.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-23\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":139,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012169\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012827\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012828\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012829\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012830\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012831\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000026\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9ecc0908-a983-42f7-9591-6f8d73d7488b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006689\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008255\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"MUBI\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006691\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Is This Thing On?\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family \u2014 forcing them to navigate co-parenting, identity, and whether love can take a new form.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"As their marriage quietly unravels, Alex seeks new purpose in the New York comedy scene while Tess confronts the sacrifices she made for their family.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-01-30\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":121,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ngmu5zGOa7s\",\"displayPriority\":1,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002276\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003003\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003138\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006446\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007571\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012836\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012837\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012838\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\",\"0000000003\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"4e47345d-b26d-4559-847e-3add7a11d75a\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006691\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008257\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures - UK\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006718\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"LSFF: Awards Ceremony & Screening (2026)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Join London Short Film Festival, the filmmakers, our partners and film fans for our annual awards ceremony and screening of the 2026 winning films. A chance to watch the cream of the crop as we announce the awards, followed by the winning films screened in full from the UK and International competitions as decided by our prestigious jury, and the Lo-Budget winners judged by our youth jury.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The winning films from the London Short Film Festival category competitions.\\r\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-01\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":120,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006718\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008291\",\"eventId\":\"0000000024\",\"distributorName\":\"London Short Film Festival\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006609\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Marty Mauser, a young man with a dream no one respects, goes to hell and back in pursuit of greatness.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":149,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PNDVyJU99M0\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001403\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001416\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002090\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003985\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003988\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007063\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000007210\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011162\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000011923\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12808\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12809\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"12810\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e033d58e-8545-4f81-a191-03352ebe4cc0\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006609\",\"hoCode\":\"A000008158\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Entertainment Film Distributors\"},{\"id\":\"HO00006610\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Sentimental Value\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Nora Borg (Renate Reinsve) is an established Oslo stage actress; her younger sister Agnes (Inga Ibsdotter Lilleaas) has chosen family life with her young son. Though markedly different, the two are close and deeply intertwined, having been raised by a single mother after their filmmaker father\u2019s departure years earlier. When the once renowned Gustav (Stellan Skarsg\u00e5rd) attempts to cast Nora in his comeback film, old wounds bleed anew; \\\"Nora rejects his offer, prompting the isolated patriarch to cast American star Rachel Kemp (Elle Fanning), who gradually comes to realize she has unwittingly become part of a deeply personal film drama. Agnes, meanwhile, delves deeper into the family history as Gustav and Nora attempt rapprochement; but the cracks at the base of the family home run deeper than any Borg can grasp, threatening to topple an already shaky foundation.\\r\\n\\r\\nThis special preview is presented in partnership with The Observer and will feature a post-film conversation between film critic Wendy Ide and leading actor Stellan Skarsg\u00e5rd.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Sisters Nora and Agnes reunite with their estranged father, the charismatic Gustav, a once renowned director who offers stage actress Nora a role.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000006\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, suicide references\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2025-12-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":133,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gb1sSfWb1Og\",\"displayPriority\":2,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001057\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001058\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001695\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002275\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002626\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002629\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002630\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000003236\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008105\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012671\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012672\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012673\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000012674\",